    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46695" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡδύ-οινος</span></b> , 
			Dor.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁδ-</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>producing sweet
				wine</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἄμπελοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>An.</u>
					6.4.6
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-ότερος καρπός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>CP</u>
					3.15.1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>containing sweet wine</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεπαστά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Apolloph.
					6
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡδύοινοι, οἱ</span>, <i>dealers in sweet wine</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Vect.</u>
				5.3
			</span></i>.</div>
